            "samples": [
              "Pineoblastoma is a pineal parenchymal tumor. It is caused by germline DICER1 mutation or biallelic RB1 loss. DROSHA and DGCR8 mutations also cause the disease because miRNA biogenesis is disrupted. Therefore cases cluster in DICER1 syndrome and heritable retinoblastoma.",
              "DICER1 syndrome is caused by germline DICER1 loss-of-function. Therefore several rare tumors, including pineoblastoma, appear in carriers."
